## 架构图模板

```mermaid
graph TB
    subgraph Client ["客户端"]
        UI[用户界面]
        API[API网关]
    end

    subgraph Service ["服务层"]
        Auth[认证服务]
        Load[负载均衡]
        Cache[缓存层]
    end

    subgraph Core ["核心业务"]
        Process[业务处理]
        Logic[规则引擎]
        ML[ML推理]
    end

    subgraph Data ["数据层"]
        DB[(数据库)]
        Queue[消息队列]
        Storage[对象存储]
    end

    UI --> API
    API --> Auth
    Auth --> Load
    Load --> Cache
    Cache --> Process
    Process --> Logic
    Process --> ML
    Process --> DB
    Logic --> Queue
    ML --> Storage
```

